      "lineNbr": 246,
      "author": {
        "id": 1281040
      },
      "writtenOn": "2020-06-24T02:32:20Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Not really, AFAIK, the corner case where this happens is when the\nEC is restarted (e.g to go into recovery mode) and the DP alt mode is already active.\nIt\u0027s not appropriate for the NAK to just shut down the negotiation, because the\nmonitor needs to be on for the recovery mode UI, hence the attempt to recover from it.",
      "parentUuid": "da0afdcd_5508f6f1",
      "range": {
