      "lineNbr": 246,
      "author": {
        "id": 1305927
      },
      "writtenOn": "2020-06-24T16:08:02Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Maybe this is pedantic, but to be fully compliant, shouldn\u0027t we have gone through an Exit Mode sequence before blowing away our mux and alt mode state when we restarted?\n\nI\u0027m not saying that\u0027s something we need to fix, especially right now, but if we got into this situation by doing something unexpected, it might be good to note that for the benefit of future readers.",
      "parentUuid": "8f5e9a7d_c46d93cb",
